# mars-relay: generated by contact-plans/compile.mjs
# Mars rover relayed by an orbiter to a Deep Space Network station at mid-range distance (12.5 min one way; the real range is about 3 to 22 min). The orbiter-to-Earth link drops while the orbiter is behind Mars. Scale 0.001 compresses real runs.
